A/B autoboot (mt7981 / openwrt-one): fast boot + space-to-stop instead of the menu.

Replaces AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW with keyed autoboot (BOOTDELAY=1 + AUTOBOOT_KEYED +
AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=space) in the spi-nand defconfig, so autoboot runs bootcmd /
altbootcmd instead of showing the bootmenu (required for the bootcount/altbootcmd
A/B rollback path). z02 (bootcount) builds on the AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR line this adds.

--- a/configs/mt7981_openwrt-one-spi-nand_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mt7981_openwrt-one-spi-nand_defconfig
@@ -16,4 +16,6 @@ CONFIG_DEBUG_UART=y
 CONFIG_FIT=y
 CONFIG_SPI_BOOT=y
-CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_MENU_SHOW=y
+CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=1
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_KEYED=y
+CONFIG_AUTOBOOT_STOP_STR=" "
 CONFIG_USE_PREBOOT=y
